  startNode: 0
  nodes:
  - message: "There's nothing left to choose this time. You've reached the last rule."
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 1
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
  - message: "The last rule: at midnight tonight, the buses will start coming. Wait at the pavilion, then get on the bus that will take you home. You can only choose one."
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 2
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 300, y: 0}
  - message: "..."
    isPlayer: 1
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies:
    - replyText: "This is the last one, right? Tell me what I have to do."
      nextNode: 3
    nextNode: -1
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 600, y: 0}
  - message: "All you have to do is get on a bus that looks safe enough to take you back to your village. But check carefully which one will actually get you out alive. Here are the details."
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 4
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 900, y: 0}
  - message: "Wait at the pavilion. The buses will pass by one at a time. If you want a closer look at one, get up and go to it. It will wait for you. If it's not the right one, go back and sit down. The next one will come on its own."
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 5
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 1200, y: 0}
  - message: "But remember, not every bus goes where you want to go. Don't trust the sign on the front alone. Check the state of the bus and the inside too. Sometimes what you see isn't what you think."
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 6
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 1500, y: 0}
  - message: "If you ask me, I'd pick the one with bright lights, passengers, and a clear destination sign. At least it looks more trustworthy than a bus that doesn't even know where it's going."
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 7
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 1800, y: 0}
  - message: "Besides, you've been waiting all night, haven't you? If you find a bus with a seat just for you, don't hesitate too long."
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 8
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 2100, y: 0}
  - message: "But in the end, you have to choose for yourself."
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 9
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 2400, y: 0}
  - message: "I hope you get home safely tonight."
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: -1
    recordsRule: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1d6971a0b3009b244918885d863b79c1, type: 2}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 2700, y: 0}
